<description>&lt;p&gt;Islamic State militants killed a Christian who refused to renounce Jesus in Libya, and Libya's top Islamic authority banned the wearing and selling of Nike products. The FIA Islamabad Zone booked 12 deportees from Libya in a human trafficking case. A UN envoy and Libya's Saddam Haftar emphasized the need to unify executive authority, reflecting political tension. UNICEF welcomed Libya's decision to raise the minimum military recruitment age to 18. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNQW1iNndNcXdOam1DRURFeDl2cExCRk43QXZVX3BUUnRBeWFDa2hTS1AzNnkteGFvUEJrRG5rek1nQlpGRkdMTURyOWFNcDFqc0xQLUpER0o3dElzMUxXSFJQMEwxSlE5ODVPVjZtTkFobHN1cUhMYkVlbHF0LXpRNldTdFhvMEN5SzVpYVJrQ1lSQ2hMWm5INkpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPTlN4Z0NvUnBzSnd0SG9fbUx5Z25Xb19YalJBalpPVHpXZ29BUHJUem9aYTZWZkYwOGZxU1pwRXJvWEMweFhjQ0RIcWcwcHZHdUFIMXRSZHY0ZlZwZXh2bGFvTTJaUTB2OGV4SFdDX3h1YTh0clpIYU1JaWdEMk5LaUVsRlFnbzA2SWhybHR3RGcyemZlZUFj?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOWkZubmhhQUdVZ1llaDU4VFVPby0zaGl0QzM1a1pEU0w5RmxIVDVmSXlfamZmY0g3blVIWmtuUFdPYTZHZHdMUUNQbEtYazlXdGd1Q0owbjNyS0xmQ3lMVjNRcnpQMEFTOV84ejBlNXh6ekxIal93aWV1ZzY3QS0tekFPTnRGdm42ZzNLdEdhUUhhbF9wd3pGaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNbHFIZ3BqZ2hHdjZHRy13blhXNFpITGtXWi1zU202MFlUbW5HOGVfZ1hyY1FpVkJqeEdwdmYyb1VYUW43TDB2WkNoOTF5eWdDRWpJS0tCeHhvTEMxaEdndmdNdVd5dldvdDZpYmRXekUtN3hkbGJ6TGx2R1duLTZZcUh4Q1dRZW1vcm9pZTNuUHR5aEFlcmFPN25wenp0dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yabiladi.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.googl